{
  "data": [
    {
      "content": "生命的殘缺不是命運的殘缺。大多數命運是可以改變的。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 1,
      "monid": 300,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 160
    },
    {
      "content": "黑夜終將結束，黎明必將到來",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 2,
      "monid": 2987,
      "x": 240,
      "y": 220
    },
    {
      "content": "願信念與你同在。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 3,
      "monid": 3291,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 210
    },
    {
      "content": "莫以為光，就不可以復仇！莫以為光，就會被黑暗吞噬！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 4,
      "monid": 3311,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 180
    },
    {
      "content": "與惡龍纏鬥過久，自身亦會成為惡龍。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 5,
      "monid": 3414,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 170
    },
    {
      "content": "也許自我的平衡就是在不斷的創造與毀滅。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 6,
      "monid": 3550,
      "x": 280,
      "y": 200
    },
    {
      "content": "讓復仇開始吧！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 7,
      "monid": 3788,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 220
    },
    {
      "content": "神說，要有光。天暗下來，我就是光。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 8,
      "monid": 3986,
      "x": 280,
      "y": 170
    },
    {
      "content": "我曾經深深動情過這個宇宙…然，天命昭昭，餘生搖搖。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 9,
      "monid": 4169,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 200
    },
    {
      "content": "穿透雲層的陽光帶來溫暖，拂過綠葉的風兒，也格外溫柔。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": [
        3,
        4,
        5
      ],
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 10,
      "monid": 1400349,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 170
    },
    {
      "content": "秋夜微涼的星空，似在訴說著難隱的情愫。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": [
        23,
        0
      ],
      "month": [
        9,
        10,
        11
      ],
      "starttime": [
        19,
        0
      ],
      "id": 11,
      "monid": 1400372,
      "x": 280,
      "y": 170
    },
    {
      "content": "看來我有必要親自矯正一下你的發音問題了。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 12,
      "monid": 1400386,
      "x": 240,
      "y": 140
    },
    {
      "content": "激揚的浪花，總能為夏天帶來一絲清涼。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": [
        6,
        7,
        8
      ],
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 13,
      "monid": 1400396,
      "x": 210,
      "y": 180
    },
    {
      "content": "雷電之間蘊藏的奧秘，看來我還要再研究一下。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 14,
      "monid": 1400413,
      "x": 240,
      "y": 170
    },
    {
      "content": "緩緩升起的祈天燈，將託去我對你的思念。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": [
        23,
        0
      ],
      "month": null,
      "starttime": [
        19,
        0
      ],
      "id": 15,
      "monid": 1400415,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 150
    },
    {
      "content": "你和洛塔塔要和睦相處，不許吵架哦~",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 16,
      "monid": 4252,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 130
    },
    {
      "content": "我將化作微光，成為你的力量",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 17,
      "monid": 1400429,
      "x": 250,
      "y": 200
    },
    {
      "content": "積雪滿阡陌，故人不可期...",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": [
        1,
        2,
        12
      ],
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 18,
      "monid": 1400427,
      "x": 230,
      "y": 350
    },
    {
      "content": "連接王座的長階，註定是一路荊棘！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 19,
      "monid": 1400392,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 210
    },
    {
      "content": "喜鵲，從天上來，帶來你對我的思念...",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 20,
      "monid": 1400390,
      "x": 250,
      "y": 160
    },
    {
      "content": "嗯？月宮中的鵲兒又跑到哪裡玩去了？",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 21,
      "monid": 1400387,
      "x": 270,
      "y": 150
    },
    {
      "content": "不忘城的那片花兒，還在靜靜為我開著嗎？",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 22,
      "monid": 1400383,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 110
    },
    {
      "content": "長夜將明，從此再無日落。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 23,
      "monid": 4321,
      "x": 250,
      "y": 200
    },
    {
      "content": "只有真我的信念，才能造就極致的武藝！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 24,
      "monid": 4327,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 180
    },
    {
      "content": "黑夜不語，但能滿足你的所有想像。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": [
        23,
        0
      ],
      "month": null,
      "starttime": [
        19,
        0
      ],
      "id": 25,
      "monid": 4329,
      "x": 250,
      "y": 165
    },
    {
      "content": "一念凜冬至，一念群芳逝。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 26,
      "monid": 1400313,
      "x": 265,
      "y": 215
    },
    {
      "content": "花燈迎春上，佳人共此時。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 27,
      "monid": 1400332,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 220
    },
    {
      "content": "玉龍喜賀歲，祥雲萬裡騰。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 28,
      "monid": 1400333,
      "x": 270,
      "y": 185
    },
    {
      "content": "江邊歲寒留瑞雪，浮光暖意映繡年。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 29,
      "monid": 1400440,
      "x": 245,
      "y": 155
    },
    {
      "content": "龍騰滄海，天涯外遊不盡。千秋萬載，繪卷裡道乾坤。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 30,
      "monid": 1400441,
      "x": 255,
      "y": 160
    },
    {
      "content": "我捨棄了洛克珊娜這個名字，連同那可笑的責任與枷鎖一起",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 31,
      "monid": 3455,
      "x": 280,
      "y": 180
    },
    {
      "content": "只需要一點骯髒的靈魂，就能給予宇宙難以癒合的傷痛，真是有意思。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 32,
      "monid": 3476,
      "x": 270,
      "y": 150
    },
    {
      "content": "無可違背，一切皆為命中注定",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 33,
      "monid": 4275,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 160
    },
    {
      "content": "深空中的混靈閃爍，我已不再迷惘。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 34,
      "monid": 4287,
      "x": 250,
      "y": 190
    },
    {
      "content": "逆世之契，次元之合，踏星辰，吾名哀。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 35,
      "monid": 4333,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 150
    },
    {
      "content": "我端坐此處，觀日出日落，望風塵滾滾。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 36,
      "monid": 4354,
      "x": 255,
      "y": 140
    },
    {
      "content": "披上這件婚紗的那一刻，我想我是幸福的。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 37,
      "monid": 1400322,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 150
    },
    {
      "content": "為了你，我願意放棄一切！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 38,
      "monid": 1400323,
      "x": 265,
      "y": 160
    },
    {
      "content": "以吾之名為誓，魂靈為契！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 39,
      "monid": 1400380,
      "x": 255,
      "y": 200
    },
    {
      "content": "上次被你僥倖逃脫，這次沒那個運氣了！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 40,
      "monid": 1400384,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 180
    },
    {
      "content": "或許我並非最強大的，但我奉命守護你。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 41,
      "monid": 3437,
      "x": 280,
      "y": 180
    },
    {
      "content": "火焰需要靠自己的意志來燃燒，舍此之火，皆非我焰。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 42,
      "monid": 3467,
      "x": 270,
      "y": 180
    },
    {
      "content": "唯有活著，我現在所擁有的一切才有意義。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 43,
      "monid": 3541,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 160
    },
    {
      "content": "所謂的正義不過是一次僥倖的勝利，但我出現，你們連這點僥倖的機會都沒有。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 44,
      "monid": 3575,
      "x": 270,
      "y": 140
    },
    {
      "content": "夥伴從來不是以強大、弱小來衡量的，夥伴的情誼是對彼此的奉獻和責任。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 45,
      "monid": 3613,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 170
    },
    {
      "content": "無正無邪，方可無始無終，這才是永恆的意義。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 46,
      "monid": 3740,
      "x": 270,
      "y": 170
    },
    {
      "content": "讓黑暗的火焰降臨世間，它將毀滅一切，並將秩序重建。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 47,
      "monid": 1400213,
      "x": 270,
      "y": 130
    },
    {
      "content": "支離破碎的罪惡又在鏡中浮現，好似一個無法醒來的夢。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 48,
      "monid": 1400417,
      "x": 280,
      "y": 160
    },
    {
      "content": "曾經的仇恨已化為雲煙，但我們的故事不會，我永遠記得你們。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 49,
      "monid": 1400452,
      "x": 240,
      "y": 90
    },
    {
      "content": "我們分道揚鑣，一個人追尋過去，一個人步向未來。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 50,
      "monid": 1400458,
      "x": 250,
      "y": 120
    },
    {
      "content": "嘿，我是蒂朵，在一家遊泳館擔任經理。如果你也想要享受這個盛夏的歡樂，那就快來找我吧！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 51,
      "monid": 4377,
      "x": 270,
      "y": 90
    },
    {
      "content": "上可摘星攬月，下可遨遊大海，但我的日常是負責泳池的安全工作，對了，還有陪蒂朵一起玩耍和冒險~",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 52,
      "monid": 4378,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 80
    },
    {
      "content": "蒂朵是歡快的蒂朵，青啼是自由的青啼，我們永遠在一起，永遠都是最好的夥伴！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 53,
      "monid": 4386,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 100
    },
    {
      "content": "桐陰下、幽情遠，與秋無極。乘雲氣、踏雲煙，人誰我識。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 54,
      "monid": 1400319,
      "x": 270,
      "y": 140
    },
    {
      "content": "要一起吃麼？我和玉兔一起親手做的月餅。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 55,
      "monid": 1400320,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 120
    },
    {
      "content": "撐起陽傘，不要停下躍動的步伐！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 56,
      "monid": 1400363,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 150
    },
    {
      "content": "你也在等雨停嗎？還是說，在等彩虹？",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 57,
      "monid": 1400364,
      "x": 270,
      "y": 130
    },
    {
      "content": "你也在等雨停嗎？還是說，在等彩虹？",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 58,
      "monid": 1400423,
      "x": 270,
      "y": 130
    },
    {
      "content": "鈴鐺聲響，聖誕輓歌，我將為你送來禮物和驚喜。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 59,
      "monid": 1400436,
      "x": 250,
      "y": 200
    },
    {
      "content": "不是每一個度過的夏天都讓我流連忘返，但每一個即將到來的夏天都讓我滿懷期待。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 60,
      "monid": 1400475,
      "x": 250,
      "y": 150
    },
    {
      "content": "為惡者，膽怯恐懼吧。我將出現在你的面前，施以裁決！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 61,
      "monid": 1400479,
      "x": 270,
      "y": 130
    },
    {
      "content": "熾紅怒火褪去，幽藍魅焰再燃！這一拳，為了新生！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 62,
      "monid": 4401,
      "x": 235,
      "y": 240
    },
    {
      "content": "夜雨奔流本無情，凡塵依舊笑望天。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 63,
      "monid": 4422,
      "x": 250,
      "y": 165
    },
    {
      "content": "只要我眼裡的星光仍在閃爍，我便能一往無前。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 64,
      "monid": 4450,
      "x": 220,
      "y": 175
    },
    {
      "content": "真相在哪裡，我就在哪裡！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 65,
      "monid": 4452,
      "x": 255,
      "y": 210
    },
    {
      "content": "桎梏的鎖鏈終有一天要破滅，而那一天的到來將是我的終點，但不是「灰爵」的。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 66,
      "monid": 4454,
      "x": 255,
      "y": 155
    },
    {
      "content": "千秋功過憑人說，史冊如何記盛亡？",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 67,
      "monid": 4468,
      "x": 250,
      "y": 300
    },
    {
      "content": "鶴舞梅香，圓月映空，我亦消散於風。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 68,
      "monid": 1400331,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 150
    },
    {
      "content": "誒？我做巧克力的材料被放到哪裡去了？",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 69,
      "monid": 1400343,
      "x": 270,
      "y": 145
    },
    {
      "content": "該出發去下一個地方了，旅途本就沒有定所。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 70,
      "monid": 1400353,
      "x": 265,
      "y": 160
    },
    {
      "content": "小草啊小花啊，快長大吧~賽米星的春天，在呼喚著你們！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 71,
      "monid": 1400388,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 125
    },
    {
      "content": "喝下這杯花茶，好好享受這場夢幻之旅吧！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 72,
      "monid": 1400492,
      "x": 250,
      "y": 130
    },
    {
      "content": "正義執行！在超星的光芒下懺悔吧！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 73,
      "monid": 1400508,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 200
    },
    {
      "content": "矩陣展開！時空戰警們，聽從我的指揮！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 74,
      "monid": 1400509,
      "x": 255,
      "y": 160
    },
    {
      "content": "你是打算和我一對一決鬥麼？做好認輸的準備吧！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 75,
      "monid": 1400510,
      "x": 245,
      "y": 160
    },
    {
      "content": "目標已鎖定！放心，一個都跑不掉。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 76,
      "monid": 1400511,
      "x": 270,
      "y": 170
    },
    {
      "content": "你們抓不住我，連同這虛無縹緲的未來。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 77,
      "monid": 1400512,
      "x": 250,
      "y": 160
    },
    {
      "content": "陰陽相合，萬物相生，無為之道，自在其中。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 78,
      "monid": 4489,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 180
    },
    {
      "content": "微風於草木窸窣的呢喃，你可曾傾聽？",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 79,
      "monid": 4498,
      "x": 250,
      "y": 190
    },
    {
      "content": "你賦予了我們未來，而我也一定會完成你的夙願。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 80,
      "monid": 4499,
      "x": 250,
      "y": 150
    },
    {
      "content": "皇兄們都說龍騰四海，外面的世界那麼大，我怎麼能不出去見識見識呢？",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 81,
      "monid": 4500,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 120
    },
    {
      "content": "公主殿下，事到如今，只能暫且委屈您留在我的船艦上了…我保證不會向您的父皇告密。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 82,
      "monid": 4510,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 140
    },
    {
      "content": "我會奮戰到最後一刻，然後接受自己倒下的事實。但倒下的是我，而不是南霜。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 83,
      "monid": 4511,
      "x": 285,
      "y": 140
    },
    {
      "content": "末將必不辱命，誓將公主殿下完好地帶回陛下的身邊！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 84,
      "monid": 4515,
      "x": 250,
      "y": 150
    },
    {
      "content": "行者不必言深，孤獨本是常態。",
      "voice": "3",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 85,
      "monid": 4586,
      "x": 245,
      "y": 170
    },
    {
      "content": "做人如習武，習武即做人！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 86,
      "monid": 1400169,
      "x": 270,
      "y": 230
    },
    {
      "content": "悄悄告訴你喔，雲層中其實隱藏著神秘的古老國度！不信……抱你上去看看？",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 87,
      "monid": 1400286,
      "x": 310,
      "y": 140
    },
    {
      "content": "趨光而行，免得黑暗降臨到你們頭上。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 88,
      "monid": 1400347,
      "x": 280,
      "y": 190
    },
    {
      "content": "與虎同行，必為猛獸。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 89,
      "monid": 1400357,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 260
    },
    {
      "content": "天地玄機，皆在一個悟字；人生玄機，皆在一個靜字。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 90,
      "monid": 1400399,
      "x": 240,
      "y": 190
    },
    {
      "content": "朕為始皇帝，後世以計數，二世、三世至於萬世，傳之無窮！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 91,
      "monid": 1400518,
      "x": 250,
      "y": 300
    },
    {
      "content": "加速！滑板先生！目標是——閃耀的星光和……閃耀的我！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 92,
      "monid": 1400519,
      "x": 270,
      "y": 180
    },
    {
      "content": "呀！兔子先生！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 93,
      "monid": 1400520,
      "x": 270,
      "y": 190
    },
    {
      "content": "變身紅茶和縮小蛋糕，你更喜歡哪一個？",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 94,
      "monid": 1400521,
      "x": 250,
      "y": 200
    },
    {
      "content": "遊泳是夏天最棒的消暑方式，啊，西瓜也是！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 95,
      "monid": 1400523,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 160
    },
    {
      "content": "我一直在這等待著，前天我看見了一隻兔子，昨天是一頭鹿，而今天則是你。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 96,
      "monid": 1400528,
      "x": 250,
      "y": 130
    },
    {
      "content": "悄悄告訴你喔，雲層中其實隱藏著神秘的古老國度！不信……抱你上去看看？",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 97,
      "monid": 1400531,
      "x": 310,
      "y": 140
    },
    {
      "content": "龍魂對我標榜榮耀，混沌向我低語廝殺……啊，真是疲倦。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 98,
      "monid": 1400534,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 200
    },
    {
      "content": "手——要放在這個位置，懂了嗎？",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 99,
      "monid": 1400535,
      "x": 230,
      "y": 220
    },
    {
      "content": "一起走吧，去往下一個世界旅行。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 100,
      "monid": 1400536,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 140
    },
    {
      "content": "跨時空追捕！戰姬小姐的頭號通緝犯！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 101,
      "monid": 1400539,
      "x": 320,
      "y": 210
    },
    {
      "content": "水中月，鏡中花，曲中調，夢中人。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 102,
      "monid": 1400541,
      "x": 230,
      "y": 140
    },
    {
      "content": "星海明志，揚帆拓土。我會守護瓏域的繁榮，也會奔赴群星的閃耀。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 103,
      "monid": 1400544,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 145
    },
    {
      "content": "龍脈湧動，逆鱗折光，展翅臨霄，威震四方。遠古龍魂，此刻解放！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 104,
      "monid": 1400545,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 220
    },
    {
      "content": "龍脈湧動，逆鱗折光，展翅臨霄，威震四方。遠古龍魂，此刻解放！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 105,
      "monid": 1400546,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 220
    },
    {
      "content": "龍戰於野，其血玄黃。破荒長嘯，唯我獨狂！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 106,
      "monid": 1400547,
      "x": 230,
      "y": 205
    },
    {
      "content": "雪綴霜稜，寒意滲骨。梅花點點，留我獨步。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 107,
      "monid": 1400548,
      "x": 240,
      "y": 170
    },
    {
      "content": "水墨繪一方天地，煙光漾幾世漣漪。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 108,
      "monid": 1400549,
      "x": 250,
      "y": 170
    },
    {
      "content": "大鵬有朝隨風起，扶搖直上九萬裡！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 109,
      "monid": 1400551,
      "x": 250,
      "y": 150
    },
    {
      "content": "嘿……哈……嗯？！原來你沒睡著呀……對不起！！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 110,
      "monid": 1400552,
      "x": 250,
      "y": 170
    },
    {
      "content": "衡馭天下，智謀蒼生！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 111,
      "monid": 1400553,
      "x": 275,
      "y": 175
    },
    {
      "content": "天理謄言萬象中，偶影獨遊此世間。",
      "voice": "1",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 112,
      "monid": 1400586,
      "x": 245,
      "y": 170
    },
    {
      "content": "我是弗羅斯特之靈，大地之子，我要解決掉所有的外來者！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 113,
      "monid": 4532,
      "x": 245,
      "y": 140
    },
    {
      "content": "煙波浮雲忽入夢，萬翠千紅又是春。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 114,
      "monid": 4553,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 160
    },
    {
      "content": "我會在此等待，直到對的人出現…",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 115,
      "monid": 4564,
      "x": 275,
      "y": 155
    },
    {
      "content": "生命化為虛無，靈魂自有歸處。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 116,
      "monid": 4599,
      "x": 245,
      "y": 220
    },
    {
      "content": "別擔心，我們的心彼此連結，源之大樹會庇佑所有的生靈。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 117,
      "monid": 4600,
      "x": 255,
      "y": 150
    },
    {
      "content": "歡迎來到古堡做客，請盡情享受這一頓晚宴。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 118,
      "monid": 4601,
      "x": 245,
      "y": 190
    },
    {
      "content": "讓我帶你墜入蔚藍的蒼淵，聆聽窒息的心跳聲。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 119,
      "monid": 4604,
      "x": 235,
      "y": 180
    },
    {
      "content": "慈悲心固，無可撼動！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 120,
      "monid": 1400560,
      "x": 265,
      "y": 235
    },
    {
      "content": "蝴蝶扇動翅膀的頻率，隱藏著一場巨大的音樂風暴。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 121,
      "monid": 1400564,
      "x": 230,
      "y": 210
    },
    {
      "content": "即便星光未能把你照亮，也請不要忘記仰望星空...",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 122,
      "monid": 1400569,
      "x": 235,
      "y": 195
    },
    {
      "content": "你永遠都猜不到我手中的牌是什麼。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 123,
      "monid": 1400579,
      "x": 210,
      "y": 175
    },
    {
      "content": "倒計時3…2…1…！兔子先生閃亮登場！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 124,
      "monid": 1400580,
      "x": 240,
      "y": 170
    },
    {
      "content": "每次夢醒時分，我總會想起一個人。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 125,
      "monid": 1400588,
      "x": 245,
      "y": 180
    },
    {
      "content": "滑雪場上，沒有輸贏，只有盡興！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 126,
      "monid": 1400590,
      "x": 275,
      "y": 180
    },
    {
      "content": "既然來了晚宴，就別急著走吧…",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 127,
      "monid": 1400592,
      "x": 235,
      "y": 165
    },
    {
      "content": "擁抱我，或者擁抱明天。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 128,
      "monid": 1400593,
      "x": 255,
      "y": 185
    },
    {
      "content": "紅色的唇印是最後的離別。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 129,
      "monid": 1400594,
      "x": 255,
      "y": 205
    },
    {
      "content": "幽夜甦醒，熾焰再臨！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 130,
      "monid": 1400595,
      "x": 255,
      "y": 205
    },
    {
      "content": "獵魔之人可不會變老。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 131,
      "monid": 1400596,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 220
    },
    {
      "content": "若是為了到達真相的終點，無論什麼都可以失去…",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 132,
      "monid": 1400597,
      "x": 235,
      "y": 120
    },
    {
      "content": "即使充滿錯誤，我也不願在未來後悔那個什麼都沒做的自己。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 133,
      "monid": 4620,
      "x": 230,
      "y": 160
    },
    {
      "content": "凡兵之道，莫過乎一，亂世之禍，非一也。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 134,
      "monid": 4625,
      "x": 220,
      "y": 170
    },
    {
      "content": "火爐、佳餚、親人，我會守護你透過這火光所看到的一切。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 135,
      "monid": 4627,
      "x": 280,
      "y": 180
    },
    {
      "content": "當楓葉緩緩墜落，我將裡裡維斯的一切深埋在了這片大地之下。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 136,
      "monid": 4635,
      "x": 240,
      "y": 130
    },
    {
      "content": "想變成一朵絨絨菊，隨風飄蕩，永遠也不停歇。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 137,
      "monid": 4636,
      "x": 240,
      "y": 130
    },
    {
      "content": "從「吾心為哀」，到「魂歸四方」。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 138,
      "monid": 4642,
      "x": 230,
      "y": 150
    },
    {
      "content": "群星與魔法，世界本源的迴響。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 139,
      "monid": 4643,
      "x": 270,
      "y": 160
    },
    {
      "content": "能源、技術，文明演化的黃金螺旋。",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 140,
      "monid": 4644,
      "x": 260,
      "y": 150
    },
    {
      "content": "願遙遠星辰的餘暉，永遠守護我們！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 141,
      "monid": 4647,
      "x": 250,
      "y": 180
    },
    {
      "content": "願遙遠星辰的餘暉，永遠守護我們！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
      "starttime": null,
      "id": 142,
      "monid": 4648,
      "x": 280,
      "y": 150
    },
    {
      "content": "願遙遠星辰的餘暉，永遠守護我們！",
      "voice": "",
      "endtime": null,
      "month": null,
